## ¹6. Simple Path vs Complex Path (preserved)

```
SIMPLE PATH (default Chat):
  Chat → Context → select_capabilities (capability_os truth) → Policy(NONE, block-only)
       → ai_core.execution.run → TOOL_FUNCS / external.mcp.* / skill:* → Response
       ❌ NO Goal created, ❌ NO forced planner

COMPLEX PATH (Agent Runtime):
  Intent → Goal → Planner → _execute_task → Policy(GOAL, full)
          → permission_guard / policy.request_approval → ai_core.execution.run → Execution
          → Replan on failure
```

Verification: TEST 1 asserts a trivial `get_time` call does **not** create a Goal; `GoalDecisionEngine().ingest("现在几点")` returns action ≠ `create`. ✅

