## 9. Known limitations / rollback

- **Rollback:** set `config.FEATURE_CAPABILITY_RUNTIME = False` → `capability_runtime` fully delegates to P1-prior behavior. Zero code-path edits needed.
- **`tool_to_capability` fallback:** external.mcp.* / unknown tools fall back to capability id `"tools"` (by design). `capability_runtime` does not extend the `_TOOL_TO_CAPABILITY` map — selection truth already lives in `capability_os`.
- **JS / Electron / frontend suites (e.g. phase47.4) are out of P1 scope** — UI is frozen (red line #1); P1 touches zero UI assets, so frontend behavior is unchanged by construction.
